ry 23, 2025. Signed by Judge Aileen M. Cannon on 1/17/2025. (tci) (Entered: 01/17/2025)\n01/17/2025 82 SPEEDY TRIAL REPORT by USA as to Thomas Peter Katsampes (Clayman, William) (Entered: 01/17/2025)\n01/23/2025 83 STATUS REPORT by USA as to Thomas Peter Katsampes (Schiller, Gregory) (Entered: 01/23/2025)\n01/24/2025 84 PAPERLESS ORDER OF REFERRAL TO MAGISTRATE JUDGE as to Thomas Peter Katsampes. Pursuant to 28 U.S.C. \u00a7 636 and the\nMagistrate Rules of the Local Rules of the Southern District of Florida, this matter is hereby referred to United States Magistrate Judge\nRyon M. McCabe for Change of Plea Hearing to take all necessary and proper action as required by law and/or to submit a Report and\nRecommendation to this Court regarding the Change of Plea by Defendant, Thomas Peter Katsampes. The parties shall submit via email to\nJudge Ryon M. McCabe's chambers a stipulated factual proffer and any written plea agreement in Word prior to the scheduled change of\nplea hearing. Signed by Judge Aileen M. Cannon on 1/24/2025. (tci) (Entered: 01/24/2025)\n01/24/2025 85 PAPERLESS Order as to Thomas Peter Katsampes Setting Change of Plea Hearing set for 2/27/2025 at 02:00 PM in Courtroom 3, 4th\nFloor, West Palm Beach Division before Magistrate Judge Ryon M. McCabe. Signed by Magistrate Judge Ryon M. McCabe on 1/24/2025.\n(spe) (Entered: 01/24/2025)\n02/04/2025 86 PAPERLESS ORDER denying as moot 74 Motion to Appoint Public Defender as to Thomas Peter Katsampes (2). Defendant withdrew\nhis motion before the Magistrate Judge on January 17, 2025 80 . Signed by Judge Aileen M. Cannon on 2/4/2025. (ir) (Entered:\n02/04/2025)\n02/27/2025 87 PAPERLESS Minute Order for proceedings held before Magistrate Judge Ryon M. McCabe: Change of Plea Hearing as to Thomas Peter\nKatsampes held on 2/27/2025 Thomas Peter Katsampes (2) Guilty Count 1s,2s. Defendant remanded into USM custody. Written Report &\nRecommendation to follow. Total time in court: 46 minutes. Attorney Appearance(s):